        <!-- ===== Notes ===== -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="nginx · cron · redis = singletons   |   PHP-FPM = scaled (PHP_REPLICAS, default 3)&#10;Reverse proxy terminates TLS → HTTP :80 (MOODLE_SSLPROXY) · nginx LB via Docker DNS round-robin&#10;MariaDB = standalone stack (docker-compose.db.yml, external volume) · Garage active when FILESTORAGE_BACKEND=s3&#10;Deploy: deploy.sh code = rolling replica replace · upgrade = maintenance-mode DB migration&#10;— solid: always-on path     - - - dashed: optional / external integration" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
